ience\n\n* A brand new room has been added with a fun twist\n* Includes AI interactions, parkour sections, and extra challenges for players to enjoy \ufffd\ufffd\n\n## \ufffd New Cosmetics Added!\n\n* \ufffd Lightsaber Cosmetic \u2014 2,000 in the shop\n* \ufffd Red Sweater Cosmetic \u2014 2,000 in the shop\n\n## \ufffd Content Creator Support\n\n* Added a Content Creator Headset for creators to use when making videos\n* More creator-focused features coming soon...\n\n# \ufffd Improvements\n\n* Major performance improvements \u2014 lag has been reduced significantly \ufffd\n* Added a new performance settings button\n\n  * You can now disable most features that may cause lag for smoother gameplay\n\n# \ufffd Sneak Peek\n\n* More updates coming soon for Content Creators \ufffd\n* Additional content and features are in development...", "created_date": 1779490004, "id": "26312822888419927", "version": "1.4", "version_code": 14, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25893807563654797", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26313240585044824"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1625633008724821"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1778521900, "id": "26173464489022435", "version": "1.3", "version_code": 13, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2589380756365